WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back with both legs long.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Flex one foot and lift that leg toward the sky.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep the other leg heavy on the floor.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Pulse gently or hold.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
